AIL-STE 1
Metadata {"capability_grants":[],"external_bindings":[],"failures":[],"package":"integer-loop","profile":"Application","target_support":{},"version":"0.1.0"}
Data action = "SumToN"
Data total = "out.total"
Data counter = "work.i"
Data zero = "i:0"
Data one = "i:1"
Data current = "f:work.i"
Data limit = "f:n.value"
Data comparison = "<="
Data addition = "f:out.total f:work.i +"
Data increment = "f:work.i i:1 +"
Data head = "head"
Data body = "body"
Data end = "end"
Data event = "Calculated"
Procedure action.
Record the start of action action.
Evaluate integer expression zero into field total.
Evaluate integer expression one into field counter.
Mark label head.
If integer comparison current comparison limit is true, go to label body.
Go to label end.
Mark label body.
Evaluate integer expression addition into field total.
Evaluate integer expression increment into field counter.
Go to label head.
Mark label end.
Record trace event event.
Select output field total.
Return success.
End procedure.
